      'This page introduces the articles filed under architecture. An architecture article describes how the parts of a system fit together: what each part does, what it receives, what it sends and what happens when it fails. The aim is a description that a new team member can read in one sitting and then draw from memory.',
      'Name every part once and use the same name each time. A reader who meets two names for one part will assume there are two parts. Show the parts in a table or a diagram, then explain each connection in a sentence that names its source, its target and the data that crosses it.',
